{"id":"e57623a088eec9a8","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-liar-paradox.md","title":"Liar Paradox","display":"df-liar-paradox — Liar Paradox","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-liar-paradox","aliases":["90-df-liar-paradox"],"display":"df-liar-paradox — Liar Paradox","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-liar-paradox"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-liar-paradox</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-liar-paradox — Liar Paradox"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed formal signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory supporting diagonalization)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (fixed syntax encoding)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (candidate internal truth formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}\\)</span> (liar-configuration predicate, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}liar\\text{-}paradox}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nL\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(L\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\tau(\\overline{g(L)})\\bigr)\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\tau(\\overline{g(L)})\\leftrightarrow L\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}liar\\text{-}paradox}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nL\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(L\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\tau(\\overline{g(L)})\\bigr)\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\tau(\\overline{g(L)})\\leftrightarrow L\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>前一个等价由对角构造给出；后一个等价是应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的 T-模式实例。</li>\n<li>两者合起来使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L\">\\(T\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L\\)</span>。因此一致理论不能在与自身句法同一层的语言中拥有满足全部 T-模式的真谓词。</li>\n<li>候选内部真理公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 与编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 都是配置签名的一部分；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ead6ebad4464a6c6\" href=\"?note=ead6ebad4464a6c6\" title=\"90-df-truth-predicate\">90-df-truth-predicate</a> 定义的是外部元语言谓词，不能作为这里的内部公式来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (sentence, see [[90-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"ead6ebad4464a6c6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"候选内部真理公式 $\\tau$ 与编码 $g$ 都是配置签名的一部分；[[90-df-truth-predicate]] 定义的是外部元语言谓词，不能作为这里的内部公式来源。","embed":false}],"math":[{"t